r to resignation ((including approaching the Audit Committee/Board of Directors along with the date of communication made to the Audit Committee/Board of Directors)<br> 7. Other facts relevant to the resignation, if any.<br>   The response of the Company is awaited.", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Clarification", "difference": "00:00:06", "dt": "25082020134840", "exchdisstime": "25-Aug-2020 13:48:46", "fileSize": "-", "hasXbrl": false, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "104478770", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE591Q01016", "sm_name": "Suumaya Industries Limited", "sort_date": "2020-08-25 13:48:40", "symbol": "SUULD"}, {"an_dt": "22-Aug-2020 16:29:54", "attFileSize": null, "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUULD_22082020162954_Book_Closure_.pdf", "attchmntText": "Suumaya Lifestyle Limited has informed the Exchange that Register of Members & Share Transfer Books of the Company will remain closed from 27-Sep-2020 to 29-Sep-2020 for the purpose of Annual General Meeting.", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Book Closure", "difference": "00:00:04", "dt": "22082020162954", "exchdisstime": "22-Aug-2020 16:29:58", "fileSize": "-", "hasXbrl": false, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "104475235", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE591Q01016", "sm_name": "Suumaya Industries Limited", "sort_date": "2020-08-22 16:29:54", "symbol": "SUULD"}, {"an_dt": "22-Aug-2020 16:22:13", "attFileSize": null, "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUULD_22082020162213_Appointment_of_Statutory_Auditor_.pdf", "attchmntText": "Suumaya Lifestyle Limited has informed the Exchange regarding Appointment of M/s. Naik Mehta & Co., Chartered Accountant,as Statutory Auditor of the Company.", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Change in Auditors", "difference": "00:00:04", "dt": "22082020162213", "exchdisstime": "22-Aug-2020 16:22:17", "fileSize": "-", "hasXbrl": false, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "104